OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order parade dispute
OL,4,Acontinues as main players hold talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters had blocked the road over
OL,7,Fthe weekend, and after a meeting with
OL,8,Fthe Northern Ireland secretary, a
OL,9,Frepresentative of the road's residents
OL,10,Fsaid the Orange Order should focus on a
OL,11,Fdifferent route for its Drumcree
OL,12,Fparade.
OL,14,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,15,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,16,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,17,Fwas due to go ahead for the first time
OL,18,Fin 30 years after a series of legal
OL,19,Fchallenges.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
